Fixed 2026-07-20: typecheck_return aggregate-initializes the result
object from a braced-init-list when the return type is an aggregate
([stmt.return]/2, [dcl.init.list]/3.4, [dcl.init.aggr]); the
[dcl.init.list]/3.2 same-class single element still takes the
copy/move path.
